{"t":"000720.KS","n":"Hyundai Engineering & Construction Co.,Ltd.","ex":"KSE","cur":"KRW","px":69800.0,"chg":3500.0,"chgPct":0.05279,"prev":66300.0,"dayH":70700.0,"dayL":68100.0,"w52H":198400.0,"w52L":59200.0,"vol":485862,"avgVol":413863,"mcap":7846249889792,"pe":null,"fpe":12.11,"eps":null,"feps":null,"pb":null,"div":800.0,"divY":0.0121,"beta":1.55,"short":null,"shortPct":null,"shortRatio":null,"prof":{"c":"South Korea","cKo":"대한민국","s":"Industrials","sKo":"산업재","i":"Engineering & Construction","iKo":"엔지니어링 및 건설","city":"Seoul","emp":null,"web":"https://www.hdec.kr","sum":"Hyundai Engineering & Construction Co.,Ltd. engages in the civil engineering and construction business in Middle Asia, Asia, Africa, and internationally. It operates through Building/Housing, Civil Engineering, Plant/Power, and Others segments. The company constructs roads and bridges, tunnels and railways, and maritime and port, apartment, luxury homes, and large complex as well as develops industrial facilities, mixed-use development and hotel, hospitals and offices, and special buildings. It is also involved in energy infrastructure construction, including large nuclear power plants, oil and gas, oil refining and petrochemicals, industrial plants, transmission lines and substations, renewable energy, and nuclear decommissioning. In addition, the company engages in steel structure manufa","sumKo":"현대건설(주) 중동, 아시아, 아프리카 등 해외 토목 및 건설사업에 종사하고 있습니다. 건축/주택, 토목공학, 플랜트/전력 및 기타 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. 도로, 교량, 터널, 철도, 해상 및 항만, 아파트, 고급주택, 대규모 단지 등을 건설하고 산업시설, 복합개발 및 호텔, 병원 및 사무실, 특수건물 등을 개발하는 회사입니다. 또한 대규모 원자력 발전소, 석유 및 가스, 정유 및 석유화학, 산업 플랜트, 송전선 및 변전소, 재생 에너지, 원자력 해체 등 에너지 인프라 건설에도 참여하고 있습니다. 또한, 회사는 철강 구조 제조에 종사하고 있습니다."},"fin":{"annual":[{"y":2022,"rev":11978479000000,"ni":422971000000},{"y":2023,"rev":15778844000000,"ni":372127000000},{"y":2024,"rev":16730103000000,"ni":-168663000000},{"y":2025,"rev":31062900000000,"ni":231330000000}],"quarterly":[{"q":"4Q2025","rev":4124938000000,"ni":50611000000},{"q":"1Q202